vars: {
  d2-config: {
    layout-engine: elk
    theme-id: 103
  }
}

direction: down

A: Homework done?\nGovernance, audit,\nsimplify, lifecycle {shape: diamond}
B: Do the homework first
C: How many rules\n& devices? {shape: diamond}
D: Rate of change? {shape: diamond}
E: Automation\nrecommended
F: Manual +\nperiodic review
G: Team has\nDevOps/Python skills? {shape: diamond}
H: Open source or\nhybrid stack
I: Commercial\nNSPM platform
J: Invest in team\n& process discipline

A -> B: No
A -> C: Yes
C -> D: < 500 rules, < 5 devices
C -> E: 500+ rules, 5+ devices
D -> F: Stable — few changes/month
D -> E: Dynamic — weekly+ changes
E -> G
G -> H: Yes
G -> I: No
F -> J
